* INV (static CMOS)
.subckt INV out a vdd gnd
Mp out a vdd vdd pmos L=22n W=88n
Mn out a gnd gnd nmos L=22n W=44n
.ends INV

* NAND2 (static CMOS, internal node x between the series NMOS)
.subckt NAND2 out a b vdd gnd
Mpa out a vdd vdd pmos L=22n W=88n
Mpb out b vdd vdd pmos L=22n W=88n
Mna out a x gnd nmos L=22n W=88n
Mnb x b gnd gnd nmos L=22n W=88n
.ends NAND2

* NOR2 (static CMOS, internal node y between the series PMOS)
.subckt NOR2 out a b vdd gnd
Mpa y a vdd vdd pmos L=22n W=176n
Mpb out b y vdd pmos L=22n W=176n
Mna out a gnd gnd nmos L=22n W=44n
Mnb out b gnd gnd nmos L=22n W=44n
.ends NOR2

* AND2 = NAND2 + INV (internal nodes x and n = NAND2 output)
.subckt AND2 out a b vdd gnd
Mpa n a vdd vdd pmos L=22n W=88n
Mpb n b vdd vdd pmos L=22n W=88n
Mna n a x gnd nmos L=22n W=88n
Mnb x b gnd gnd nmos L=22n W=88n
Mpi out n vdd vdd pmos L=22n W=88n
Mni out n gnd gnd nmos L=22n W=44n
.ends AND2

* OR2 = NOR2 + INV (internal nodes y and n = NOR2 output)
.subckt OR2 out a b vdd gnd
Mpa y a vdd vdd pmos L=22n W=176n
Mpb n b y vdd pmos L=22n W=176n
Mna n a gnd gnd nmos L=22n W=44n
Mnb n b gnd gnd nmos L=22n W=44n
Mpi out n vdd vdd pmos L=22n W=88n
Mni out n gnd gnd nmos L=22n W=44n
.ends OR2
